	(text "GP6 and BED_PROBE high = Q951 and Q952 conduct\n= the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a bed's\ntrigger (BED_PROBE low), a dead MCU (100k\nholds the base low) or a cut wire: the\nMelzi's pull-up (R401) wins = triggered.\nNo bed: R970 holds BED_PROBE high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "abb7545e-b3d4-4fce-bcdd-352f857b4f12")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a5444b29-e087-431c-bde3-d991ecb38975")
	)
	(text "The board: the hub's DN3 on J957 (+5V_HUB on RAW, +3V3_PH = E+).\nAlone: its own USB-C, J957 unplugged (never both: two hosts).\nThe tool's 5 V and its return: the hub board only, not on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e4f2eb97-b0db-449b-84e4-986ebf23a0b3")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2358cd2f-4458-40f2-aa9b-3bea8da70db5")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed at the gauges: orange = E, blue = S.\nWhite-green: the tool's ID. Green and the browns: spare.\nSign and grams on the bench; diag() noise with a tool going on and off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e56a4ad-f6cd-49e6-ab25-948f358a1a79")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44769bd6-9a5a-4ab5-8c64-b63be47a0186")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nRatiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+.\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2f122898-82f3-4441-a6ff-a3e98d183b51")
	)
	(text "THE TOOL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "62f2c70e-6d75-48e4-8c42-12be206cff01")
	)
	(text "GP26: the ID (later the link), GP27: its pull-up, GP9:\nthe tool's 5 V. Data pins inputs until the tool has 5 V.\nGP21: CS2 now (was GP8; no feet chip: plot_bed.json's feet CS),\nGP2: TOUCH_GP (was GP6). GP28 free (the QRE: set aside)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ecaa73f6-b795-4e60-b320-749ed65fc7c0")
	)
