	(text "BED_DATA: a half-duplex UART on one wire (GP0, PIO open-drain,\nlib/link.py). BED_PROBE: the bed's trigger, high = OK, low = triggered:\nGP1 reads it, and Q952 (the touch line, above) puts it in series with\nthe touch line in hardware. R970 holds it OK with no bed."
