	(text "Both on MP_Buck1 (+5V_TOOL_IN over J957). GP4: U956,\nthe bed (BED_PWR, it takes little): on once the ID reads\nsteady, off on \"no bed\" for 250 ms. GP5: U957, +5V_SW\non J959: the LEDs and whatever else needs 5 V.\nHigh = on; the 100k hold each off through a reset.\nSlide switches at OFF (else always on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 350.52 0)
		(effects
